# Local deps (web/node_modules also in web/.gitignore; functions/ via functions/.gitignore)
node_modules/
# Machine-local swiftly pin. `xcode` is a macOS-only selector: committing it breaks every
# swiftly-proxied swift invocation on Linux ("version xcode ... doesn't match any of the
# installed toolchains"). Keep a local `.swift-version` containing `xcode` on macOS dev
# machines (the desktop target requires the Xcode toolchain); never track it.
.swift-version
